# 🧊 Legacy Frozen Giant Showdown

## 📌 Purpose

This is a preserved reference of the older Frozen Giant Showdown concept. It is **not final GIANTBOUND design**.

## 🎄 Original Concept

A multiplayer Christmas mini-game where one player becomes a Giant Frozen Yeti and the remaining players become Survivors. Survivors complete Frozen Parkour, reach cannons, and shoot the Yeti before time runs out.

## 👥 Players

- 2–10 players
- 1 Giant Frozen Yeti
- Remaining players are Survivors

## 🗿 Giant Frozen Yeti

- ❤️ 1000 HP
- 🚫 Could not directly eliminate players
- 🪤 Could create obstacles and make parkour harder

## 🎯 Survivor Objective — Legacy

Survivors had to complete Frozen Parkour, reach the Cannon Area, enter a cannon, and shoot the Yeti.

- 💥 Each cannon hit = 25 damage
- 🎯 40 hits required to reach 0 HP

## 🔄 Respawn — Legacy

Falling into the ice did not eliminate a player. The player respawned at the start after 2 seconds.

## 🪤 Legacy Giant Shop

The Giant could earn Ice Tokens and buy:

- 🧱 Ice Wall
- 🧊 Slippery Floor
- 🌬️ Snow Wind
- ❄️ Freeze Zone
- 🗡️ Ice Spikes
- 🌨️ Snow Storm
- 🌉 Ice Bridge Freeze
- 🧊 Moving Ice Blocks

## ⚡ Legacy Giant Powers

- 🥶 Freeze Players — 2 seconds
- 🧊 Entire Floor Slippery
- 🌨️ Giant Snow Storm
- 🧱 Giant Ice Wall
- ❄️ Blizzard
- 🪤 Ice Trap
- 🌪️ Snow Tornado

## 🧰 Legacy Survivor Shop

Temporary upgrades included:

- 🪖 Helmet
- 👢 Speed Boots
- 🦘 Double Jump
- 🛡️ Shield
- 🎯 Better Cannon Aim
- 🔄 Faster Reload

These reset after the match and were not permanent gameplay advantages.

## 🧗 Legacy Parkour

- 🧊 Moving Ice Platforms
- 💥 Breaking Ice Bridges
- 🧊 Slippery Floors
- 🔄 Rotating Ice Platforms
- ⛷️ Frozen Jump Pads
- 🧱 Ice Obstacles

## 🎁 Legacy Lucky Gift Boxes

Possible rewards included speed boost, shield, double jump, event currency, and temporary buffs.

## 🌨️ Legacy Snow Storm

Reduced visibility for players.

## 🔔 Legacy Santa Bell

Disabled Giant powers for 10 seconds.

## 🦌 Legacy Reindeer Assist

Could provide a shortcut, speed boost, bridge repair, or event currency.

## 🚫 Buddy Rescue — REMOVED

The old concept contained a Buddy Rescue system with temporary team-wide buffs. This system is explicitly removed from GIANTBOUND and must not be carried forward.

## ⚔️ Legacy Win System

The old concept used Yeti HP reaching 0 as the Survivor win condition and time expiration as the Yeti win condition.

⚠️ This is **not final for GIANTBOUND**. New Giant and Tiny Player win conditions must be designed separately.

## 🏆 Legacy Rewards

The old concept included coins, XP, Buddy XP, gift tokens, Christmas stars, candy canes, achievements, and event progress.

GIANTBOUND will have its own Rewards system, which still needs to be designed.
